{{JPExclusive}}
'''Nana & Doge''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 11.1 Update|Version 11.1]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Nana & Doge
|image = E 596.png
|appearance = [[Kaohsiung Rapid Transit Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Nana & Doge has high health, low attack, range and a fierce Mini-Wave + Slow combo with Omni-Strike attacks.

==Strategy==
Although she has high enough health to be considered a tank, only two stages she is in has her appear at 100% or higher magnification. Due to her low range anything that can outrange her is instantly a safe option to use since she will be attacking the meatshields sent out.<br>
Her Mini-Wave + Slow combo can seem scary at first, but it is just above one and a half seconds long but if the player has a [[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield Cat]] then her combo is practically nullified.

